ras/2cfa04b0bc8e122d44d851d669797c5a.mp4?t=1755539291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>More Adult Content</strong> \u2013 Hotter scenes, new mechanics, and more ways to rule with pleasure.<br></li><li>\u2744\ufe0f <strong>A Deadly New Threat</strong> \u2013 The Ice Horde \u2013 Ancient creatures from the North that will shake up the game and force tough choices.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc51 <strong>Politics &amp; Seduction</strong> \u2013 Use power, cunning, or sheer sexual dominance to get what you want.<br></li><li>\ud83d\udc8b <strong>New Stunning Characters</strong> \u2013 From sultry queens to mysterious witches, every encounter can change your destiny.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udf0e <strong>A Living, Reactive World</strong> \u2013 Your actions shape the fate of cities, kingdoms, and entire civilizations.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571570/extras/3b8bb79d4aaccecb7c42ba16ebcf66c5.poster.avif?t=1755539291\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571570/extras/3b8bb79d4aaccecb7c42ba16ebcf66c5.webm?t=1755539291\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571570/extras/3b8bb79d4aaccecb7c42ba16ebcf66c5.mp4?t=1755539291\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Will you conquer with fire or freeze under the pressure? Your choices will decide in Sex of Thrones 2!",
